                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Honestly this is a really good game, hopefully there will be more story expansion in the future. Bonus points for having the VA cast from the series!\r\nA note for anyone who has not watched the RWBY series: this plot takes place roughly somewhere between seasons 2 and 3.\r\nController mapping for an Xbox controller is pretty good, made some delay between pressing a button and the action triggering but to be fair it could just be due to the age of my controller.\r\nGraphics have improved from the last time I played about 6 to 10 years ago. \r\nSince the games is basically unfinished I would wait to buy it when it goes on sale, 20USD is a lot for a game that is \"considering future content updates, but no details yet\" according to FarBridge FAQ webpage section. With Burnie Burns buying back Rooster Teeth there is hope of seeing more content for RBWY.",
